      en: ["The only region in Angola with significant cocoa production.", "Specialized in sustainable extraction of tropical hardwoods.", "Takes advantage of the Congo basin's extremely high rainfall.", "Important site for research on tropical crops.", "Major employer for the local population in Cabinda.", "Encourages the emergence of local processing units.", "Contributes to the economic stability of the exclave.", "A model for balancing forest protection and agricultural use."]
