      en: ["Central park in the Ingombota district of Luanda.", "Hosts statues and plaques on the history of the liberation struggle.", "An important venue for political and cultural gatherings.", "Provides a rare green oasis in the densely built city centre.", "Popular spot for photos on national holidays.", "Has been beautified several times during urban renewal.", "Symbol of the freedom and unity of the Angolan people.", "Part of the historic walking tour through old Luanda."]
