      en: ["Most important centre of Angolan maize production.", "Uses ideal conditions for growing winter cereals.", "Hosts some of Africa's oldest agricultural research stations.", "Central player in the national self-sufficiency programme.", "Major supplier for the milling industry in Caála and Huambo.", "Has state-of-the-art silos for long-term storage of harvests.", "A pioneer in applying crop rotation management.", "Symbol of the transformation of traditional agriculture."]
